key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-27T11:47:05-07:00","id":1465541,"title":"","content":"That's great :v","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-27T11:50:59-07:00","id":1465542,"title":"","content":"Sadly, there's not much to the preview. There's the fact that the Second Inquisition is called &quot;The Coalition&quot; officially (because calling yourself the Inquisition in the 21st century is going to go over like a ton of bricks) and they are more of a loose knit association of various groups rather than one singular entity.<br /> <br /> Also that they employ Deprogrammers for Kindred victims.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-27T12:13:49-07:00","id":1465546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1465542#post1465542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also that they employ Deprogrammers for Kindred victims.</div> </div> </div> </div>That doesn't sound sinister at all. I mean, the Men in Black use a hand held device to make the problematic memories (of victims) go away. You can get the same result with a .45 pistol - it's also handheld, produces a flash and means the problematic memories (of victims) go away.<br /> <br /> But yeah, the preview is parsimonious.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-27T13:53:07-07:00","id":1465562,"title":"","content":"A Deprogrammer IIRC is someone that works on undoing brainwash and such things.<br /> <br /> <i><b>With less than than savory methods</b></i>.<br /> <br /> It is a whole market of people that offer their services to families that think their loved ones had been brainwashed by cults or just by badly behaved girlfriends.<br /> <br /> They kidnap the target, use a host of extremely violent &quot;deprogramming techniques&quot; of ill repute, with the result being someone pliable that responds as the family wanted, at least for enough time for the deprogrammer to get paid and go away.<br /> <br /> Deprogrammers cause a lot of suffering in situations that already aren't easy when they arrive, and let behind messed up families and deeply traumatized victims.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-01T09:00:43-07:00","id":1466132,"title":"","content":"I looked over the teaser and I find very lacking of anything useful, except for 1/3 of it (i.e. 2 pages out of six). The remaining 2/3 were info we already know we're going to get. Basically, IMV, I didn't need/want 1 page of the cover, 1 page of the rear cover, 1 page of &quot;credits&quot;, and 1 full page of artwork. They could've given a sample page of actual tools of the SI.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">R<i>emember, remember, the Fifth of November, the Gunpowder Treason and Plot. I know of no reason why the Gunpowder Treason should ever be forgot.</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> -V for Vendetta</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/997-japheth","name":"Japheth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar997_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"122"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-01T09:34:57-07:00","id":1466138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1465562#post1465562\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Deprogrammer IIRC is someone that works on undoing brainwash and such things.<br /> <br /> <i><b>With less than than savory methods</b></i>.<br /> <br /> It is a whole market of people that offer their services to families that think their loved ones had been brainwashed by cults or just by badly behaved girlfriends.<br /> <br /> They kidnap the target, use a host of extremely violent &quot;deprogramming techniques&quot; of ill repute, with the result being someone pliable that responds as the family wanted, at least for enough time for the deprogrammer to get paid and go away.<br /> <br /> Deprogrammers cause a lot of suffering in situations that already aren't easy when they arrive, and let behind messed up families and deeply traumatized victims.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wonder at the choice of word given that Kindred really CAN brainwash people and control minds.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-01T09:39:29-07:00","id":1466139,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1466138#post1466138\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I wonder at the choice of word given that Kindred really CAN brainwash people and control minds.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That is still (kinda) exit <span style=\"color:#202122\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">counseling. Honestly will be interesting to see how much hedge magic/technocratic resources the SI have.<br /> <br /> and ofc, nothing called The Coalition with a humanocentric ideology and dreams of genocide has ever been bad in RP games </span></span></span><img src=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQRCj9MFYYlvlMYs_TKFAb3iun72WmpbEi4tw&amp;usqp=CAU\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 11-01-2021, 12:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-01T09:50:26-07:00","id":1466143,"title":"","content":"&quot;The Coalition&quot; sounds infuriatingly vague. <br /> <br /> I get that criminal groups really like to be vague (&quot;Cosa Nostra&quot; really just means &quot;our thing&quot; and is a term transformed into a name by outsiders to the mafia) but &quot;the Coalition&quot; isn't a parallel for &quot;our thing&quot; it's obviously some kind of political body and doesn't have the same deniability as &quot;our thing&quot;. It's too defined to be a code and too nonspecific to be a good fucking name. Like a placeholder that never got replaced.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-01T09:57:45-07:00","id":1466144,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1466138#post1466138\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder at the choice of word given that Kindred really CAN brainwash people and control minds.</div> </div> </div> </div>Real cults can, too, even if not in a magical overpowered way.<br /> <br /> IRL Deprogrammers don't work. They are snake oil sellers for this kind of thing, with the added aspect of using traumatic tactics.<br /> <br /> By the way, tactics they use because they are brainwashing too. They just wear off later because this is what RL brainwash does naturally when it isn't constantly reinforced.<br /> <br /> So they basically and violently brainwash the target into behaving as the family expects them to behave for enough time for the Deprogrammers to get paid and leave.<br /> <br /> After that, it is just as horrible on the victims as any other cruel brainwash program. So it is either as bad as what the family thought they were saving the victims or way worse, adding to trauma and suffering.<br /> <br /> Now, I say this because they can go that route in two ways. They my have Deprogrammers that are there to ensure their own goals but cause just as much harm or more than the vampires, or the want the SI to somehow have &quot;real&quot; Deprogrammers that work better for saving people.<br /> <br /> My problem will be if they chose the latter, as it will be profoundly disrespectful with rl victims of Deprogrammers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-01T10:37:13-07:00","id":1466147,"title":"","content":"Deprogramming is an odd thing to pick in general. It's extremely out of zeitgeist, being rooted in pop-psychiatric beliefs and conspiracy lore of the 60s-70s, when people thought that &quot;brainwashing&quot; and mind control are actual things that are possible. But lack of effectiveness and scientific developments led to these ideas, and the deprogramming industry, becoming fringe. It still exists in some capacity, but it's a dying jackal snatching its last few victims. Like how TV Psychics are no longer a big thing.<br /> <br /> You wouldn't put Illuminati as an SI faction in the book, and you wouldn't have SI flying around in black helicopters - you are instantly showing your age with this old-ass conspiracy lore.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12892-kammerer","name":"Kammerer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12892_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-01T13:45:51-07:00","id":1466162,"title":"","content":"Perhaps the point is, to show the age of those who run the Inquisition, which aren't exactly young West Coast liberals. Like, the whole thing was set up by two paranoid conspiracy theorists within the NSA and Pentagon, who suddenly got their &quot;AH, I WAS RIGHT, I'VE ALWAYS BEEN RIGHT&quot; moment.<br /> <br /> What could possibly go wrong, when you bring together religious zealots, the surveillance States, black ops and fringe thinkers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12590,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","user":"Manfr","date":". 11-02-2021, 05:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-02T00:29:41-07:00","id":1466232,"title":"","content":"True, for every member of the Society of Leopold who has an at least somewhat accurate if incomplete understanding of vampires, the movement probably boasts several conspiracy theorists who think they're pod replicants escaped from Area 51 or shape-shifting reptillians. (Hmm, and running across someone from the Ministry isn't exactly going to dissuade the latter belief...)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-02T03:43:41-07:00","id":1466245,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1466162#post1466162\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Perhaps the point is, to show the age of those who run the Inquisition, which aren't exactly young West Coast liberals. Like, the whole thing was set up by two paranoid conspiracy theorists within the NSA and Pentagon, who suddenly got their &quot;AH, I WAS RIGHT, I'VE ALWAYS BEEN RIGHT&quot; moment.<br /> <br /> What could possibly go wrong, when you bring together religious zealots, the surveillance States, black ops and fringe thinkers?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hell, a lot of the West Coast liberals will be the ones to automatically reject the idea that, &quot;Yes, vampires are literally the Damned and cursed by God.&quot;<br /> <br /> Part of the fun of the Society of Leopold is they're better educated than the vast majority of Cainites. They just don't care.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 11-02-2021, 07:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-02T05:49:42-07:00","id":1466269,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1466245#post1466245\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hell, a lot of the West Coast liberals will be the ones to automatically reject the idea that, &quot;Yes, vampires are literally the Damned and cursed by God.&quot;<br /> <br /> Part of the fun of the Society of Leopold is they're better educated than the vast majority of Cainites. They just don't care.</div> </div> </div> </div>Allow me to once again lament the inadequacy of the SoL loresheet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12892-kammerer","name":"Kammerer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12892_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-02T06:17:28-07:00","id":1466274,"title":"","content":"I think it's pretty established that the SoL know as much BS as they do truth. Granted, they know a lot of truth, but that makes the mountain of bullshit they've accumulated even more impressive.<br /> <br /> <br /> The main issue still lies in the parts where power is going to be really reluctant to hunt vampires. Getting rid of corrupt sacrilegious paedophilic parasites isn't what governing bodies are known for. If anything, the two hold hands and die together.<br /> <br /> The second issue is that the bigger an organizational web is, the easier it'd be for vampires to find the strings and follow them into a bloodbath.<br /> <br /> So Dominate got nerfed to oblivion in V5 but still, it's a supernatural power, can a &quot;deprogrammer&quot; even with the most ethical and legitimate methods actually cope with that? Can they fight blood bonds or Presence? It sounds like a massive stretch. A few kindred do have cults or &quot;programmer&quot; like behaviours but they're few and far between outside of a few know-nothing herds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-02T06:31:59-07:00","id":1466278,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1466274#post1466274\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it's pretty established that the SoL know as much BS as they do truth. Granted, they know a lot of truth, but that makes the mountain of bullshit they've accumulated even more impressive.<br /> <br /> <br /> The main issue still lies in the parts where power is going to be really reluctant to hunt vampires. Getting rid of corrupt sacrilegious paedophilic parasites isn't what governing bodies are known for. If anything, the two hold hands and die together.<br /> <br /> The second issue is that the bigger an organizational web is, the easier it'd be for vampires to find the strings and follow them into a bloodbath.<br /> <br /> So Dominate got nerfed to oblivion in V5 but still, it's a supernatural power, can a &quot;deprogrammer&quot; even with the most ethical and legitimate methods actually cope with that? Can they fight blood bonds or Presence? It sounds like a massive stretch. A few kindred do have cults or &quot;programmer&quot; like behaviours but they're few and far between outside of a few know-nothing herds.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't want to open a discussion on Disciplines, but being able to erase memories since Level 1 and bypassing the 30y ban on self-harm at level 5 don't seem heavy nerfs to me. <br /> <br /> Anyway, when your enemy employs brainwashing powers and addictive substances, Deprogrammers trying to violently brainwash people and starving their addiction seems a natural trope to exploit, especially if you are as villanious as them.<br /> <br /> As for the problems SI would face with Vampiric influence on the Government, the Camarilla book gives us various examples. <br /> <br /> Kindred fighting back is quoted several times, from the Camarila derailing Poindexter's career and almost disbanding IAO, to Ishaq Khan losing his family (but this may have happened before the founding of the group), to the Russian Brujah stopping the Eight Directorate. Princes are quoted as using the Inquisition against their enemies, from FBI to BOES. <br /> <br /> Pg. 76-77 give us more details about how Camarilla influence is reacting to the SI, noting that the SI is compelled to act in secrecy and also maintain the Masquerade itself, and that the Camarilla still has enough power to force SI to &quot;keep their actions secret even from their own putative masters&quot;, as &quot; The ease with which we officially dismantled the IAO provides a constant reminder of this&quot;.<br /> <br /> So, the game lore acknowledges vampire influence and the problems it causes to SI.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12590,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","user":"Manfr","date":". 11-02-2021, 09:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-02T07:27:57-07:00","id":1466282,"title":"","content":"<br /> A level 5 power; verbally compelling people to shoot themselves<br /> A level 0 power: shooting people.<br /> Sure it's great for asserting your Dominance but it can hardly be described as an effective use for 25xp. What we had before was better. My main concern, however, is the loss of subtle mesmerize. &quot;I want you to call XXXX if you see Randy or John and tell the person on the phone where they are&quot; or &quot;when you return to your colleagues, shoot them&quot; or &quot;Tell me what you know about Unobtech&quot; or &quot;every time you see a fat grandma, I want you to wolf whistle her&quot; were all perfectly valid Mesmorize commands in V20 and aren't in V5. In V5, they zone out, have to complete their task immediately, and can't do anything that requires &quot;cognition&quot; (IE anything useful)<br /> <br /> <br /> Point being, a SI could easily be systematically destroyed by any odd Malk with the willingness to do so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-02T11:26:04-07:00","id":1466304,"title":"","content":"I don't think the changes in Dominate are enough to change the subject of Deprogrammers. If they have a sensible approach to them, then I completely agree that they are more than fitting a theme, as the SI is going to be presented as actually more villains than heroes.<br /> <br /> Will them work against supernatural powers? If they're done as actual Deprogrammers, this is actually besides the point. Those people don't unmake stuff, they just add theirs. It is like getting the boy mesmerized to whistle at fat grandmas and mesmerizing him again so he shouts bullshit right after whistling, contextualizing the act and making him seen &quot;clean&quot;.<br /> <br /> Of course, as they're doing it with mundane methods, irl it would fade over time reasonably quickly. But a game isn't rl and I don't mind it being a little more powerful as long as it isn't painted as a good, healthy thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-13T06:13:09-08:00","id":1467676,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1466143#post1466143\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;The Coalition&quot; sounds infuriatingly vague.<br /> <br /> I get that criminal groups really like to be vague (&quot;Cosa Nostra&quot; really just means &quot;our thing&quot; and is a term transformed into a name by outsiders to the mafia) but &quot;the Coalition&quot; isn't a parallel for &quot;our thing&quot; it's obviously some kind of political body and doesn't have the same deniability as &quot;our thing&quot;. It's too defined to be a code and too nonspecific to be a good fucking name. Like a placeholder that never got replaced.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you've ever worked in a Public Service agency though, that's exactly the sort of nothing-name that you'll get. They want something that doesn't sound ridiculous to say (or that would undermine the seriousness of their work), but they also want something simple, generic, and with plenty of deniability.<br /> <br /> E.g. the UK's G7 Policing op was called Op Trelawny, a complete nothing of a name.<br /> <br /> A Coalition could be anything in a government context: military, political, social, an old boy's network, etc. It gives them a degree of deniability, whilst still carrying enough weight to carry authority.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kammerer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1466147#post1466147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Deprogramming is an odd thing to pick in general. It's extremely out of zeitgeist, being rooted in pop-psychiatric beliefs and conspiracy lore of the 60s-70s, when people thought that &quot;brainwashing&quot; and mind control are actual things that are possible. But lack of effectiveness and scientific developments led to these ideas, and the deprogramming industry, becoming fringe. It still exists in some capacity, but it's a dying jackal snatching its last few victims. Like how TV Psychics are no longer a big thing.<br /> <br /> You wouldn't put Illuminati as an SI faction in the book, and you wouldn't have SI flying around in black helicopters - you are instantly showing your age with this old-ass conspiracy lore.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The difference here is that the SI has objective evidence of actual brainwashing taking place. Not in the sense of psychological manipulation either, but in an almost cartoon supervillain way of simply catching a victim's eyes and muttering a few words.<br /> <br /> I think in light of that developing a way to counteract it would be a fairly logical step, not only to treat civilians affected but also their own operatives as part of debriefs. Fall of London calls out explicitly that they find ways of detecting Presence and Dominate, even screening for Blood-Bonds via blood-samples.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STV Author - <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/374164/Guide-to-the-Sabbat?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=0_0_45624_0_0_0_0\" target=\"_blank\">Guide to the Sabbat</a> <br /> Current Project(s): Tales from the Fronts - A Guide to the Gehenna War","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25061-karos","name":"Karos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25061_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-13T11:57:56-08:00","id":1467701,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467676#post1467676\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you've ever worked in a Public Service agency though, that's exactly the sort of nothing-name that you'll get.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually The Coalition is still a bit too much. That's why they love acronyms. Instead it could very well be something like ICSB - International Cooperation Service Bureau.<br /> <br /> Nice, iconic, unique, yet it means fucking nothing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-13T13:14:37-08:00","id":1467710,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467701#post1467701\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually The Coalition is still a bit too much. That's why they love acronyms. Instead, it could very well be something like ICSB - International Cooperation Service Bureau.<br /> <br /> Nice, iconic, unique, yet it means fucking nothing.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ehh, I think there's a balance to be struck there. Sometimes an Acronym is more suitable and disposable, other times a codeword works better. If you see the word coalition crop up a few times, that's not too strange necessarily. An acronym almost calls attention to itself though, as you would wonder what the acronym stands for.<br /> <br /> Also just call all the hunters 'The Coalition' probably works better for regionalisation, just translate the same word. Whereas in other languages you'd get radically different acronyms. (Akin to USSR in the West and CCCP in the East during the cold war.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STV Author - <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/374164/Guide-to-the-Sabbat?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=0_0_45624_0_0_0_0\" target=\"_blank\">Guide to the Sabbat</a> <br /> Current Project(s): Tales from the Fronts - A Guide to the Gehenna War","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25061-karos","name":"Karos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25061_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-13T13:36:27-08:00","id":1467715,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467710#post1467710\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">An acronym almost calls attention to itself though, as you would wonder what the acronym stands for.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think this is necessarily a bad thing. First, finding out what the acronym stands for doesn't explain anything. In my example you go from random letters that mean nothing to random words that still mean nothing.<br /> <br /> Second, when you're in a situation where you deal frequently with dozens of departments defined by acronyms you eventually stop caring that much.<br /> <br /> Probably in the end it depends more on how similar groups are named in a given region, but international governmental coalitions already work a lot based on acronyms.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467710#post1467710\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also just call all the hunters 'The Coalition' probably works better for regionalisation, just translate the same word. Whereas in other languages you'd get radically different acronyms.</div> </div> </div> </div>That changes nothing. People will just get used to their local acronym and that's that. Here in Brazil no one knows what's WHO, UN, NATO or EU, but we're just fine with OMS, ONU, OTAN and UE. Why would it be any different going from The Coalition to A Coaliz\u00e3o?<br /> <br /> Yes, the acronyms change a lot. So what?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467710#post1467710\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Akin to USSR in the West and CCCP in the East during the cold war.</div> </div> </div> </div>This phrase was kind of unfortunate. It isn't &quot;in the west&quot; and &quot;in the east&quot;. The US didn't control other countries to the point of owning rights to say the only true way of making the acronym.<br /> <br /> It wasn't USSR here, as it isn't USA. Both those acronyms change with languages throughout the world. There is a lot of assumptions here about how the US's view is representative of the rest of &quot;the west&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-13T13:57:32-08:00","id":1467720,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467715#post1467715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think this is necessarily a bad thing. First, finding out what the acronym stands for doesn't explain anything. In my example you go from random letters that mean nothing to random words that still mean nothing.<br /> <br /> Second, when you're in a situation where you deal frequently with dozens of departments defined by acronyms you eventually stop caring that much.<br /> <br /> Probably in the end it depends more on how similar groups are named in a given region, but international governmental coalitions already work a lot based on acronyms.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the fact that an acronym prompts that curiosity though would be an issue. Wondering what it might stand for is the first step on the path to wanting to know what it does. Whereas if you just read the word coalition in a paper you might not think it refers to a specific coalition. (Meanwhile, those in the know, understand from context which coalition is being referred to.)<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> That changes nothing. People will just get used to their local acronym and that's that. Here in Brazil no one knows what's WHO, UN, NATO or EU, but we're just fine with OMS, ONU, OTAN and UE. Why would it be any different going from The Coalition to A Coaliz\u00e3o?<br /> <br /> Yes, the acronyms change a lot. So what? </div> </div> </div>It's easier to recognise a cognate word than it is a random jumble of letters essentially. If I read Coalition (English), Koalition (German), or Coaliz\u00e3o (Portuguese, please correct me if I'm wrong), I can infer what that means. Whereas if I see a completely distinct series of letters I'd have nothing to go off save maybe the same number of letters?<br /> <br /> Ultimately neither approach is perfect, but I think there's an argument for a broad umbrella utilising a common codename, then using acronyms more for specific groups within that larger umbrella.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> This phrase was kind of unfortunate. It isn't &quot;in the west&quot; and &quot;in the east&quot;. The US didn't control other countries to the point of owning rights to say the only true way of making the acronym. </div> </div> </div>I never said they did, this is explicitly a generalisation to serve as an example. In what the Cold War world would've typically defined as 'The West' i.e. NORAD/NATO nations the 'enemy' was known as the USSR, the anglicisation of the Russian. Meanwhile, in what would've been termed 'The East' by Westerners it was the CCCP because that was the acronym derived from Russian.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It wasn't USSR here, as it isn't USA. Both those acronyms change with languages throughout the world. </div> </div> </div>Which reinforces the main point I was making that an acronym will have more diverse iterations potentially than a single common word that may have cognates in several languages.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> There is a lot of assumptions here about how the US's view is representative of the rest of &quot;the west&quot;. </div> </div> </div>To be sure, my intention wasn't really to delve into those nuances by way of an off-hand example that was simply the first thing to come to mind. A valid discussion to be sure, just not one to have by way of a throwaway example, as it wouldn't really do it justice.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STV Author - <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/374164/Guide-to-the-Sabbat?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=0_0_45624_0_0_0_0\" target=\"_blank\">Guide to the Sabbat</a> <br /> Current Project(s): Tales from the Fronts - A Guide to the Gehenna War","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25061-karos","name":"Karos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25061_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-13T14:07:44-08:00","id":1467722,"title":"","content":"<b>Prediction: The Second Inquisition will be a bunch of assholes</b><br /> <br /> I think deprogramming was shown to us for a very specific mood setting reason. It's something associated with the paternalistic &quot;We know better than you&quot; society that the Special Affairs Division of the FBI (which was founded by Hoover as a jack booted thuggish group) and NSA has a history of. A thing to remember is the Second Inquisition almost certainly will not be the good guys and I expect this book to be full of absolutely vile things.<br /> <br /> * Torture<br /> * Kidnapping<br /> * Murdering witnesses/vampire victims<br /> * Internment camps<br /> * Human experimentation<br /> * Probably hints of racism and sexism<br /> <br /> The vampires are bad but the Inquisition will undoubtedly be filled with the kind of Right Wing authoritarian vibe the Technocracy had originally but with the addition of religious fanatics.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 11-13-2021, 05:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-13T17:09:18-08:00","id":1467736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467720#post1467720\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the fact that an acronym prompts that curiosity though would be an issue.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, but it goes both ways. At the same time that an acronym may garner some curiosity, an undefined Coalition showing up here and there too, with an added problem: what if people start to ask which coalition is that?<br /> <br /> Think about it in terms of an actual situation where it may come around. An acronym promptly says it is a rolled up group inside other organization, while the Uppercase Coalition brings a more specific question: which coalition is that? Coalition of who, with whom?<br /> <br /> Keeping in mind who are the actual components of the SI, you may have a situation where an FBI agent either leave a document behind or must namedrop something when asked by someone else, from a journalist to a superior, what they're doing.<br /> <br /> If the FBI (already itself an acronym that means nothing, by the way) slip a random acronym with generic meaning, it may be a random department under any random subsection of the government. If they slip the Coalition, the question arises: the FBI is in coalition with whom? Why?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467720#post1467720\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's easier to recognise a cognate word than it is a random jumble of letters essentially. If I read Coalition (English), Koalition (German), or Coaliz\u00e3o (Portuguese, please correct me if I'm wrong), I can infer what that means.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, it isn't. Because if you come about the word Koalition, it is likely that the entire context where this word was found is in German. If you know German and is an SI member, then you probably know their acronym for it. If not, you don't really have context to infer because you can't read the context. But you may still know their acronym for it, if it even is different.<br /> <br /> Quite a lot of people around the world know what CIA and FBI means with no need for even knowing how you pronounce that in English. Acronyms work well as cross-language names. Look at how you know perfectly well what CCCP means even without a hint at the actual words in Russian (I don't, at least, except that they're actually other letters than they seem to be because it's Cyrillic).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467720#post1467720\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ultimately neither approach is perfect, but I think there's an argument for a broad umbrella utilising a common codename, then using acronyms more for specific groups within that larger umbrella.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, but the gist of it in the end is that they may operate as such from the vampires' perspective, but they aren't actually an umbrella organization, but a cooperation between specific organizations from other places.<br /> <br /> One impression I have with The Coalization is that it looks too much like declaring a formal alliance its members don't really have the authority to declare.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467720#post1467720\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In what the Cold War world would've typically defined as 'The West' i.e. NORAD/NATO nations the 'enemy' was known as the USSR, the anglicisation of the Russian.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's what I tried to tell you, it isn't. It just isn't.<br /> <br /> Every member of NATO had its own acronym for the Soviet Union, and it worked perfectly well that way. If there is one common acronym, by the way, it is probably URSS as it is the most common romance translation of the Russian. The same goes for countries then under Russian influence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-14T08:22:40-08:00","id":1467791,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467722#post1467722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[B]Prediction:I expect this book to be full of absolutely vile things.<br /> <br /> * Torture<br /> * Kidnapping<br /> * Internment camps<br /> * Probably hints of racism and sexism</div> </div> </div> </div>In 5th? heavens no. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The vampires are bad but the Inquisition will undoubtedly be filled with the kind of Right Wing authoritarian vibe the Technocracy had originally but with the addition of religious fanatics. </div> </div> </div>'vibe' would be an understatement. Fortunately they won't be racist or sexist. Wouldn't want people to be uncomfortable with our fictional fascist paramilitary extremist group.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-14T08:36:34-08:00","id":1467792,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467791#post1467791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In 5th? heavens no.<br /> <br /> 'vibe' would be an understatement. Fortunately they won't be racist or sexist. Wouldn't want people to be uncomfortable with our fictional fascist paramilitary extremist group.</div> </div> </div> </div>We already have actual examples of some of these things taking place in 5th edition...<br /> <br /> The Chicago Folios already has explicit scenarios where the SI have kidnapped Kindred/civilians and experimented on them. If that doesn't meet the standards of: torture, kidnapping, and internment camps, I'm not sure what does?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STV Author - <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/374164/Guide-to-the-Sabbat?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=0_0_45624_0_0_0_0\" target=\"_blank\">Guide to the Sabbat</a> <br /> Current Project(s): Tales from the Fronts - A Guide to the Gehenna War","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25061-karos","name":"Karos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25061_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-14T09:01:25-08:00","id":1467796,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467792#post1467792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We already have actual examples of some of these things taking place in 5th edition...<br /> <br /> The Chicago Folios already has explicit scenarios where the SI have kidnapped Kindred/civilians and experimented on them. If that doesn't meet the standards of: torture, kidnapping, and internment camps, I'm not sure what does?</div> </div> </div> </div>There is this convinction, running around, that 5th edition is bland because ParaWolf has taken away all of the controversial and interesting things of metaplot, destroying the game for mature gamers. <br /> <br /> Then, you know, there is also the convinction that 5th edition is edgy / nazi /alt right, and that ParaWolf is just putting awful things here and there, destroying the game for socially conscious gamers. <br /> <br /> Sometimes, there is a middle ground, in which originally 5th edition was NAZIEDGY and then it was extremely retconned in BLANDPOLITICALLYCORRECT in desperate effort to save the franchise. And it's just generally destroying VtM. <br /> <br /> Of course, sooner or later ParaWolf will tank the game, a good knight will step in and everything will be retconned out of existence. Then, VtM will be returned to its only right and true setup, which seems to be an amalgam of late V2 and V20: apparently early V2 is too gross and flashy, but Revised is too opinionated on how you should play Vampire. <br /> <br /> In any case, don't try to argue that V5 is not a reboot and is connected to earlier metaplot and editions. Never. Ever. It is a reboot, it doesn't fit in Vampire continuity, and suggesting otherwise is bad. <br /> <br /> Welcome to Internet discussions about V5 \ud83d\ude01","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12590,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","user":"Manfr","date":". 11-14-2021, 12:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-14T17:08:39-08:00","id":1467839,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467791#post1467791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In 5th? heavens no.<br /> <br /> 'vibe' would be an understatement. Fortunately they won't be racist or sexist. Wouldn't want people to be uncomfortable with our fictional fascist paramilitary extremist group.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You made my day with this passage. Yeah, I am amazed how arbitrary people's issues are. People are fine with playing bloodthirsty monsters who lie, cheat, kidnap and murder. But Wendigo and KotE are an abomination because presenting pop mythology of other cultures in a no no. Playing monsters descended from Caine is ok tho, somehow. <br /> <br /> And to the subject at hand:<br /> <br /> Since SI book is not beig made by Onyx Path I am not expecting much from it but let's hope that there will be some gold nuggets buried inside I can use in my games. Time will tell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2357-sathriel","name":"sathriel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-14T19:29:32-08:00","id":1467846,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467796#post1467796\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In any case, don't try to argue that V5 is not a reboot and is connected to earlier metaplot and editions. Never. Ever. It is a reboot, it doesn't fit in Vampire continuity, and suggesting otherwise is bad.<br /> <br /> Welcome to Internet discussions about V5 \ud83d\ude01</div> </div> </div> </div>All the beliefs you described exist and are, indeed, both common and silly, as their simplistic view don't achieve anything beyond stagnant animosity.<br /> <br /> Yet, this post isn't any better. Besides applying the same simplification and dismissing the entire idea of discussing with someone that may not hold the same views as you, what does it accomplish?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>sathriel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467839#post1467839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, I am amazed how arbitrary people's issues are.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe they're not as arbitrary, as you think just because they don't relate to you. Don't be so dismissive of things you didn't even put the effort to understand why the affected parties feel offended.<br /> <br /> And to put it to rest:<br /> <br /> Wendigo and KotE aren't problems because of some White Knight feeling hurt in the name of others. They're problems because <b>players of the described ethnicity complained in numbers and with arguments.</b><br /> <br /> Now guess what: those people don't owe <u><b>you</b></u> any explanation. If you want to understand, go find out yourself instead of demanding explanations and deriding their reasons.<br /> <br /> ===================<br /> <br /> On my part: I don't like some of Paradox decisions on lore, nor most of their executions. I do feel that their vision of the game is demonstrably restricted and it affects negatively a lot of lore.<br /> <br /> But I don't see it coming from fear of depicting racism or anything like that. It is possible that something have changed, but until now they have been bold on the issues they actually want to tackle. I don't have high expectations for the SI book, but I don't have especially low ones, either. I literally just don't know what to expect about aspects like <i>deprogramming</i> and racism.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-14T19:47:46-08:00","id":1467849,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>sathriel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467839#post1467839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You made my day with this passage. Yeah, I am amazed how arbitrary people's issues are. People are fine with playing bloodthirsty monsters who lie, cheat, kidnap and murder. But Wendigo and KotE are an abomination because presenting pop mythology of other cultures in a no no. Playing monsters descended from Caine is ok tho, somehow.<br /> <br /> And to the subject at hand:<br /> <br /> Since SI book is not beig made by Onyx Path I am not expecting much from it but let's hope that there will be some gold nuggets buried inside I can use in my games. Time will tell.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>Dismissing cultural appropriation of the Wendigo as an actual taboo practiced by Native American religion is not a small matter or a fandom one. It is something that really angers a lot of people.<br /> <br /> Please take a warning.</b></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 11-14-2021, 10:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T05:36:10-08:00","id":1467872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467846#post1467846\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Maybe they're not as arbitrary, as you think just because they don't relate to you. Don't be so dismissive of things you didn't even put the effort to understand why the affected parties feel offended.<br /> <br /> And to put it to rest:<br /> <br /> Wendigo and KotE aren't problems because of some White Knight feeling hurt in the name of others. They're problems because <b>players of the described ethnicity complained in numbers and with arguments.</b><br /> <br /> Now guess what: those people don't owe <u><b>you</b></u> any explanation. If you want to understand, go find out yourself instead of demanding explanations and deriding their reasons.<br /> <br /> ===================<br /> <br /> On my part: I don't like some of Paradox decisions on lore, nor most of their executions. I do feel that their vision of the game is demonstrably restricted and it affects negatively a lot of lore.<br /> <br /> But I don't see it coming from fear of depicting racism or anything like that. It is possible that something have changed, but until now they have been bold on the issues they actually want to tackle. I don't have high expectations for the SI book, but I don't have especially low ones, either. I literally just don't know what to expect about aspects like <i>deprogramming</i> and racism.</div> </div> </div> </div>I understand them I just disagree with them. Would we care if Christians complained that WoD presents warped/exploitative/mocking view of their faith? <br /> <br /> I am not demanding any explanations as: 1) the explanations were presented and I know them 2) I am presenting my opinion regarding those explanations. That's my $0.02 on the subject as it is not to be discussed here. <br /> <br /> And on that we agree: Paradox wants WoD5 to be streamlined (in reality stripped down) version of the franchise. And don't get me wrong, there is a lot of room for streamlining in WoD but in my book they go with a sledgehammer to do the things they should approach with precise laser.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2357-sathriel","name":"sathriel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T05:47:06-08:00","id":1467873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>sathriel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467872#post1467872\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I understand them I just disagree with them. Would we care if Christians complained that WoD presents warped/exploitative/mocking view of their faith?<br /> <br /> I am not demanding any explanations as: 1) the explanations were presented and I know them 2) I am presenting my opinion regarding those explanations. That's my $0.02 on the subject as it is not to be discussed here.<br /> <br /> And on that we agree: Paradox wants WoD5 to be streamlined (in reality stripped down) version of the franchise. And don't get me wrong, there is a lot of room for streamlining in WoD but in my book they go with a sledgehammer to do the things they should approach with precise laser.</div> </div> </div> </div><b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">You were literally just warned about this. Please leave the thread.</span></b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T09:21:30-08:00","id":1467885,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467722#post1467722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Prediction: The Second Inquisition will be a bunch of assholes</b></div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, I agree with this assessment. I'll repeat what I've said before; at a meta-level the S.I. will fulfill a role for the game similar to that of the Sabbat in first edition. Namely, they will be a force that the Camarilla cannot stop and contains vampires to cities and city politics. Your coterie doesn't like the locals and thinks the Prince is a pillock - too bad, because it's either the Prince or the S.I. You choose between the skillet (i.e. the Camarilla) or the fire (the S.I.)<br /> <br /> The S.I. might throw some moral and ethical light on the vampires, and how vampires operate, but mostly the S.I. will antagonists. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T10:32:53-08:00","id":1467889,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't say they are a force that cannot be stopped. From Chicago to the Visual Novels and Text Games, I feel their threat has been toned down, so they aren't the end of all vampires, just a threat. I'd say the big inquisition moves like Vienna or London aren't going to happen again, now that Kindred are used to them. <br /> <br /> At least I hope that is what happens, I like the SI conceptually but I prefer them to be a background threat most of the time, the consequences for being lousy with the Masquerade. Though even the corebook says they could be that so. Honestly I just wish the SI book has some information on fighting back the second inquistion, besides waiting them out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27145,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27145-setitefriend","user":"SetiteFriend","date":". 11-15-2021, 01:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27145-setitefriend","name":"SetiteFriend","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27145_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T11:27:11-08:00","id":1467892,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SetiteFriend</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467889#post1467889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wouldn't say they are a force that cannot be stopped. From Chicago to the Visual Novels and Text Games, I feel their threat has been toned down, so they aren't the end of all vampires, just a threat. I'd say the big inquisition moves like Vienna or London aren't going to happen again, now that Kindred are used to them.<br /> <br /> At least I hope that is what happens, I like the SI conceptually but I prefer them to be a background threat most of the time, the consequences for being lousy with the Masquerade. Though even the corebook says they could be that so. Honestly I just wish the SI book has some information on fighting back the second inquistion, besides waiting them out.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'd mostly like some kind of rationale offered for why they could drone strike a building in a major European capital, blame that on foreign/Islamic terrorists, and the result somehow not being, let's call it politely, global political instability and strife beyond the usual. That's the sort of thing countries get invaded over and nations go police state over. That's the sort of thing gleefully leapt on by racists as an excuse for indulgence in their prejudices beyond the usual.<br /> <br /> There's a lot that bothers me about the writing for the SI, but that has always been glaring to me as a &quot;this makes no sense&quot;. Look at how Western countries react to terrorist attacks on their home soil and what they are used as political capital for. Something on the scale of &quot;an entire building was successfully drone striked by terrorists in Vienna&quot;? The idea that terrorists control military drones and can unleash them on Europe's major cities at will? There would be a huge freakout.<br /> <br /> And if the answer is &quot;the SI is so powerful and influential that somehow, despite all logic to the contrary, it prevented this reaction&quot;, then we are right back to &quot;then how are there any vampires left anyway.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","user":"MarkK","date":". 11-15-2021, 02:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T11:32:43-08:00","id":1467894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467892#post1467892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I'd mostly like some kind of rationale offered for why they could drone strike a building in a major European capital, blame that on foreign/Islamic terrorists, and the result somehow not being, let's call it politely, global political instability and strife beyond the usual.<b> That's the sort of thing countries get invaded over and nations go police state over. That's the sort of thing gleefully leapt on by racists as an excuse for indulgence in their prejudices beyond the usual.</b><br /> <br /> There's a lot that bothers me about the writing for the SI, but that has always been glaring to me as a &quot;this makes no sense&quot;. Look at how Western countries react to terrorist attacks on their home soil and what they are used as political capital for. Something on the scale of &quot;an entire building was successfully drone striked by terrorists in Vienna&quot;? The idea that terrorists control military drones and can unleash them on Europe's major cities at will? There would be a huge freakout.<br /> <br /> And if the answer is &quot;the SI is so powerful and influential that somehow, despite all logic to the contrary, it prevented this reaction&quot;, then we are right back to &quot;then how are there any vampires left anyway.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, doesn't this take place in the World of Darkness? Doesn't the central tenet of the game state that there are vast powerful conspiracies massively affecting things?<br /> <br /> And who would go to war? With who? The Austrian government is undoubtedly the people who dropped the bomb. Are you having the weird idea it was America? The SI has been shown to be international for many books now.<br /> <br /> It's not like there haven't been terrorist attacks in the European Union of a similar size in RL. An RL that has far less overt violence and horrifying events than the WOD. Who exactly would be reported killed?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T12:00:24-08:00","id":1467898,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467894#post1467894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean, doesn't this take place in the World of Darkness? Doesn't the central tenet of the game state that there are vast powerful conspiracies massively affecting things?<br /> <br /> And who would go to war? With who? The Austrian government is undoubtedly the people who dropped the bomb. Are you having the weird idea it was America? The SI has been shown to be international for many books now.<br /> <br /> It's not like there haven't been terrorist attacks in the European Union of a similar size in RL. An RL that has far less overt violence and horrifying events than the WOD. Who exactly would be reported killed?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Second Inquisition did a thing, and offered a cover story for it that seems tailor made to have political parties, people in the street and even militaries demanding that whatever terrorist organization got blamed for it be hunted down and wiped out with extreme effort as possible, with associated crackdowns within home countries. There would be demands for tangible results. Not then producing them is the sort of thing that gets governments voted out and replaced with more extreme ones promising those results, even if that is in fact impossible. How do you think the average not really all that tolerant person in the street would react to being given the idea that terrorists, especially ones who, you know, look different from them and follow a different religion, now control military drones that they can blow up buildings in major European cities with.<br /> <br /> <br /> If the Second Inquisition is so powerful that it can prevent governments and people from freaking out from the idea being presented to them that Islamic terrorists have military drones they can attack Europe with, then the Second Inquisition is so powerful that vampires everywhere should be flat out dead. If the Second Inquisition controls Western militaries alone so tightly that they would not, as an example, start redrawing their entire operational procedures and strategies to reflect that terrorists have military drone strike capacity deep into Europe and reporting to their government how mind bogglingly bad that is, then it is so powerful that it may as well in fact be the pre Reckoning Technocracy, but now focused on killing vampires, in which case again, how are still vampires. If the Second Inquisition's control over armies, governments, the media and what have you is so absolute that this would not in fact happen, why are still vampires.<br /> <br /> Terrorists who can military drone strike the Western world would have intelligence agencies, media organizations and all sorts of things freaking right out and demanding/needing to know how the hell that happened. The SI not just being able to maintain its cover story in the face of that, but preventing the most likely responses of all that kind of thing means they are so globally powerful and influential that again, why are vampires.<br /> <br /> If you can maintain your suspension of disbelief that there would not be cries for retributive violence across the EU from political parties and people in the street alike at whatever they think would qualify, that there would not be &quot;thinkpieces&quot; in the media blaring about how now anyone can be attacked from wherever by terrorists with military effing drones and the destructive capacity they wield, then your understanding of the world and mine differ so sharply that there is not likely to be mutual comprehension here.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It's not like there haven't been terrorist attacks in the European Union of a similar size in RL. An RL that has far less overt violence and horrifying events than the WOD. Who exactly would be reported killed? </div> </div> </div>Name me a terrorist attack in the EU that involved not simply bombings or shootings or stabbings on the ground, but the acknowledgement that terrorists now have long range military drone strike capability that can take out buildings and such was why the incident happened. You seem to want to handwave that detail and nothing works like that. Going &quot;the world of darkness&quot;, should in fact mean, since this is a world even darker than ours, that the response should be even harder terrified racist freakouts. The SI cover story involves saying a terrorist organization can now do the long ranged destructive thing that major developed countries can do.<br /> <br /> The demand would be for some, let's call it a &quot;war on terror&quot; maybe, with the responsible parties, until the idea that Europe can be hit with military drone strikes by terrorists can claim to have been resolved.<br /> <br /> A public story that terrorists have military quality drones they can attack European cities with and the inclination to do so, with a corroborating incident to back it up, is like a step below a public story that terrorists have nukes they can attack European cities with, with a corroborating incident to back it up.<br /> <br /> There is a difference between &quot;a dude can shoot some people&quot; or &quot;a dude can blow himself up&quot; and &quot;now terrorists can just fire off powerful guided missiles at European cities from afar. They have the capacity to take out whole buildings.&quot; as far as how people would react to that.<br /> <br /> And yet that is the story the SI went with telling.<br /> <br /> I know people feel like they need to defend V5 a lot when someone criticizes it, but it doesn't actually mean the game will vanish in a puff of smoke to admit that it has made, in at least a couple of cases, really poor writing choices.<br /> <br /> edit: You seem to want to deflect this all with &quot;few casualties!&quot;. That's not the freakout. That's not what would send all kinds of organizations and people on the street into a tailspin. The freakout, the thing that comes with &quot;these people have military drones and are willing to use them&quot; is &quot;these people can more or less press a button from miles away and wipe things out in the Western world in the way that only advanced countries are supposed to be able to do, and have shown they can do it.&quot; The idea that even just the media alone would not be screaming that message is.. reflective of a take on history and society that does not seem to interact with the one that exists, let alone the one that would then be even worse in a world that is supposed to be even worse. Nor acknowledge that an organization that could prevent these reactions would have to be so globally powerful that the idea that its actual enemies could still exist anyway feels so thin as to be nonexistent as far as trying to deflect all this with &quot;but conspiracy!&quot;<br /> <br /> edit edit: Like an actual military drone strike in a major European city, by terrorists, would be publicly regarded and called out as a failure of intelligence, military preparedness and government. &quot;Could we be next?&quot; or &quot;Where will the missiles land next?&quot; would dominate headlines. You do not seem to be able to differentiate between or acknowledge that there is a difference between stuff people expect terrorists to be able to do, and &quot;terrorists can now do the thing militaries do, deep into Europe itself.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","user":"MarkK","date":". 11-15-2021, 03:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T12:22:13-08:00","id":1467900,"title":"","content":"IDK, everyone seemed to get along just fine with the fact that nobody noticed Pentex had gone Raccoon City with a small town, the sewers of New York hosted the Tzimisce Antediluvian, or that Ebola was a Tzimisce Methuselah, yet now we are shocked by the Second Inquisition telling everyone &quot;Yes, Al Quaeda used a drone to blow up a building&quot;.<br /> <br /> Perhaps we should be more lenient with our fantasy worlds, they are not academic works of alternate history. \ud83d\ude01 It was over the top? Yes. It was probably poor writing? Yes. Has it happened before in real life? No. Has it happened in Jason Bourne's, Jack Ryan's and similar books? A lot of times, probably. <br /> <br /> I think we should accept than WOD is closer to Jason Bourne than to RL geopolitics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12590,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","user":"Manfr","date":". 11-15-2021, 03:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T12:40:19-08:00","id":1467901,"title":"","content":"Also, in the books it isn't written that SI said that Al Quaida uses drones&quot;<br /> <br /> V5 Corebook, on pg. 361, gives us details on the attack and says USSOCOM, Vatican and Brazilian forces destroyed the Chantry with &quot;drone strikes and and relic-reinforced ground operations&quot;, then blamed it on &quot; ISIS aligned terrorists&quot;.<br /> <br /> In the Camarilla book, pg. 78, they say chantry was destroyed with &quot;as-yet unknown combination of holy relics and ground-penetrating ordnance&quot;.<br /> <br /> Which doesn't mean they said &quot;ISIS has drones&quot;, but just &quot; ISIS blew up a building in Wien&quot;. Average Joes and Fritzs probably cannot tell the difference.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12590,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","user":"Manfr","date":". 11-15-2021, 03:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T12:45:38-08:00","id":1467903,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467900#post1467900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">IDK, everyone seemed to get along just fine with the fact that nobody noticed Pentex had gone Raccoon City with a small town, the sewers of New York hosted the Tzimisce Antediluvian, or that Ebola was a Tzimisce Methuselah, yet now we are shocked by the Second Inquisition telling everyone &quot;Yes, Al Quaeda used a drone to blow up a building&quot;.<br /> <br /> Perhaps we should be more lenient with our fantasy worlds, they are not academic works of alternate history. \ud83d\ude01 It was over the top? Yes. It was probably poor writing? Yes. Has it happened before in real life? No. Has it happened in Jason Bourne's, Jack Ryan's and similar books? A lot of times, probably.<br /> <br /> I think we should accept than WOD is closer to Jason Bourne than to RL geopolitics.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Did any of the things you are talking about happen in so big and public a way that the world would have had to notice them, and then once they did get provided a cover story for them which should have logically had destabilizing effects on society and politics? If not, they are not actually comparable despite your saying they are. <br /> <br /> There is a difference between those things and telling the world at large &quot;terrorists have military drone strike capacity into Europe.&quot;<br /> <br /> Demdemeh secretly being ebola is not the same thing as governments telling their citizens &quot;Ebola is a vampire, vampires are real, and here is proof.&quot; That's not how analogies or comparisons work. <br /> <br /> There is a difference between &quot;a secret bad thing happened that 99% of the world doesn't know about&quot; and &quot;the world was given a cover story for an incident, and said cover story is so bad that it should cause multi national freakouts.&quot;<br /> <br /> Suspension of disbelief can be strained, and it can be broken. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T12:49:07-08:00","id":1467904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467903#post1467903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is a difference between those things and telling the world at large &quot;terrorists have military drone strike capacity into Europe.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>MarkK, there have been in fact terrorist bombings in Europe. Did you not know this?<br /> <br /> The London Bombings of 2005<br /> <br /> Terrorist bombings in Madrid. You're acting like attack in Europe are unprecedented.<br /> <br /> Or is the fact they're drone strikes? In which case it would kind of defeat the cover story part to claim that it was carried out by Al Qaeda.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terrorism_in_Europe#Deadliest_attacks\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terror...dliest_attacks</a><br /> <br /> I feel uncomfortable bringing RL into this, especially as the World of Darkness is much more violent as well as destructive, but this is a weird idea.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> Sorry, missed your earlier posts. Did you think the cover story included that it was a drone strike or long range? Also, what makes you think it was long range? Presumably the cover story for the event is just, &quot;terrorists set a bomb.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 11-15-2021, 03:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T12:52:41-08:00","id":1467905,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467901#post1467901\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, in the books it isn't written that SI said that Al Quaida uses drones&quot;<br /> <br /> V5 Corebook, on pg. 361, gives us details on the attack and says USSOCOM, Vatican and Brazilian forces destroyed the Chantry with &quot;drone strikes and and relic-reinforced ground operations&quot;, then blamed it on &quot; ISIS aligned terrorists&quot;.<br /> <br /> In the Camarilla book, pg. 78, they say chantry was destroyed with &quot;as-yet unknown combination of holy relics and ground-penetrating ordnance&quot;.<br /> <br /> Which doesn't mean they said &quot;ISIS has drones&quot;, but just &quot; ISIS blew up a building in Wien&quot;. Average Joes and Fritzs really cannot tell the difference.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> They used drone strikes to take out a building, by your own quotes. They then said ISIS aligned terrorists did it. That's just the book. The rest is you trying to read into it in a way that excuses these things. <br /> <br /> Alternatively, again, the Second Inquisition is so powerful that it could deploy drone strikes into a European city, but prevent militaries, intelligence agencies, the media, satelites, and what all have you, from noticing that drone strikes were deployed into a European city. There's, I don't know how else to put this, a lot of effort that goes into things by groups like, for instance, NATO to try and, let's say, be aware of when ranged explosive crap like drone strikes gets fired at Europe. <br /> <br /> If the Second Inquisition is so powerful and controlling as to just bypass all that, then we are right back at the Second Inquisition is so globally powerful that again, why are there still vampires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T12:53:18-08:00","id":1467906,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467903#post1467903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Did any of the things you are talking about happen in so big and public a way that the world would have had to notice them, and then once they did get provided a cover story for them which should have logically had destabilizing effects on society and politics? If not, they are not actually comparable despite your saying they are. <br /> <br /> There is a difference between those things and telling the world at large &quot;terrorists have military drone strike capacity into Europe.&quot;<br /> <br /> Demdemeh secretly being ebola is not the same thing as governments telling their citizens &quot;Ebola is a vampire, vampires are real, and here is proof.&quot; That's not how analogies or comparisons work. <br /> <br /> There is a difference between &quot;a secret bad thing happened that 99% of the world doesn't know about&quot; and &quot;the world was given a cover story for an incident, and said cover story is so bad that it should cause multi national freakouts.&quot;<br /> <br /> Suspension of disbelief can be strained, and it can be broken. <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Tzimisce was big enough to devastate most of New York when he rose up in Gehenna, yet no one noticed such a manmoth slim living in the sewers. <br /> <br /> Ebola has been widely studied and no one noticed it was an undead parasite. <br /> <br /> Pentex released a zombie virus, and CDC knew about it because it wiped out a town. <br /> <br /> And no, the SI didn't tell people Al Quaeda had drones. The book isn't even clear whether most damage was covered up as counter terror operations, saying it was standard SAD modus operandi.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12590,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","user":"Manfr","date":". 11-15-2021, 03:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T12:57:33-08:00","id":1467908,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467905#post1467905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> They used drone strikes to take out a building, by your own quotes. They then said ISIS aligned terrorists did it. That's just the book. The rest is you trying to read into it in a way that excuses these things. <br /> <br /> Alternatively, again, the Second Inquisition is so powerful that it could deploy drone strikes into a European city, but prevent militaries, intelligence agencies, the media, satelites, and what all have you, from noticing that drone strikes were deployed into a European city. There's, I don't know how else to put this, a lot of effort that goes into things by groups like, for instance, NATO to try and, let's say, be aware of when ranged explosive crap like drone strikes gets fired at Europe. <br /> <br /> If the Second Inquisition is so powerful and controlling as to just bypass all that, then we are right back at the Second Inquisition is so globally powerful that again, why are there still vampires.</div> </div> </div> </div>The book says it was a USSOCOM operation, they are these guys<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_Special_Operations_Command\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unit...ations_Command</a><br /> <br /> I suppose they have leverage with NATO. <br /> <br /> As for how the attack was framed by SI, please read the books : pg. 361 V5 Corebook, pg. 78 Camarilla book. <br /> <br /> Nowhere is written they justified the attack saying Al Quaeda has military drones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12590,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","user":"Manfr","date":". 11-15-2021, 03:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T12:58:41-08:00","id":1467910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467904#post1467904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> MarkK, there have been in fact terrorist bombings in Europe. Did you not know this?<br /> <br /> The London Bombings of 2005<br /> <br /> Terrorist bombings in Madrid. You're acting like attack in Europe are unprecedented.<br /> <br /> Or is the fact they're drone strikes? In which case it would kind of defeat the cover story part to claim that it was carried out by Al Qaeda.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terrorism_in_Europe#Deadliest_attacks\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terror...dliest_attacks</a><br /> <br /> I feel uncomfortable bringing RL into this, especially as the World of Darkness is much more violent as well as destructive, but this is a weird idea.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> Sorry, missed your earlier posts. Did you think the cover story included that it was a drone strike or long range? Also, what makes you think it was long range? Presumably the cover story for the event is just, &quot;terrorists set a bomb.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>You guys are working real hard at this point to say &quot;just because it said drone strikes doesn't mean it worked like drone strikes.&quot; Again. Drone strikes are a thing done by militaries. If the Second Inquisition is so powerful and influential that it can convince militaries, intelligence agencies, the media, and certainly NATO &quot;nah, that was just a bomb&quot;, then it is so globally controlling that the idea that vampires still exist makes not the sense.<br /> <br /> Also it's not particularly classy to throw in a screed to go &quot;do you not get that terrorist attacks happen in Europe?&quot;, realize I addressed that, but still leave that in anyway, as a note. <br /> <br /> If the cover story did not address that drone strikes happened, it means the Second Inquisition basically controls... Western intelligence agencies, various governments, the media, and lord knows NATO as far as being able to hide from them that drone strikes happened.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T13:03:26-08:00","id":1467911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467910#post1467910\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You guys are working real hard at this point to say &quot;just because it said drone strikes doesn't mean it worked like drone strikes.&quot; Again. Drone strikes are a thing done by militaries. If the Second Inquisition is so powerful and influential that it can convince militaries, intelligence agencies, the media, and certainly NATO &quot;nah, that was just a bomb&quot;, then it is so globally controlling that the idea that vampires still exist makes not the sense</div> </div> </div> </div>I think this is where our issue shines.<br /> <br /> You are acting like it was the Camarilla trying to do a cover up. It is not. It is the military, probably Austria's miitary, carrying out an operation and blaming it on Al-Qaeda. It is established that the Second Inquisition is government and military forces (+ the Vatican) versus vampires.<br /> <br /> Who are they trying to fool?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also it's not particularly classy to throw in a screed to go &quot;do you not get that terrorist attacks happen in Europe?&quot;, realize I addressed that, but still leave that in anyway, as a note. </div> </div> </div>You have mentioned that this sort of event leads to war and a change in the entirety of behavior of countries. I'm suggesting this is why it was a cover story.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If the cover story did not address that drone strikes happened, it means the Second Inquisition basically controls... Western intelligence agencies, various governments, the media, and lord knows NATO as far as being able to hide from them that drone strikes happened. </div> </div> </div>It does addres it. It says that Al Qaeda blew up the building and that is why it is a hole in the ground.<br /> <br /> If you're asking me, &quot;Does this mean that I think the Second Inquisition ordered the investigators to say it was a terrorist bombing and not a military drone strike?&quot; Then yes, I believe that is what happened and easy to happen in the World of Darkness.<br /> <br /> Because people are regularly killed, blackmailed, framed, bribed, and mind-controlled to cover up the supernatural. It is also a violent world with covert wars going on at all time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T13:09:05-08:00","id":1467912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think the reason people are objecting to your interpretation is the following:<br /> <br /> * The Second Inquisition IS the government. So the idea that it can cover up all those agencies is weird since its those agencies doing the coverups.<br /> * Those agencies are already thoroughly riddled with supernatural conspiracies that carry out massive military operations to begin with.<br /> * You seem to be assuming they blamed Al-Qaeda in a way that is incredibly stupid and draw attention.<br /> * There have already been mentions of similar terrorist attacks.<br /> * You seem to be believing the Tremere Chantry is in the middle of the city.<br /> * You seem to assuming anyone knew the Tremere chantry as something other than an old abandoned ruin or museum. Literally no one had any relatives or people they knew living there. Causalties could be reported as zero and no one would question it.<br /> * These kinds of cover ups happen all the time in the setting.<br /> * It isn't even that big of an event in the setting except for the vampires dying.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think the reason you and Manfr are objecting to the interpretation is that you feel V5 gets a lot of flak on this forum and that thereby it's your job to champion it against that, if I'm going to be honest.<br /> <br /> If the Second Inquisition IS the government and is that internationally powerful, why are vampires still alive.<br /> <br /> Those agencies, when they carry out operations, try to hide them without using cover stories that should cause global instability or otherwise try to perform them in ways that are hidden overall. Or, they're the Technocracy, in which case if the Technocracy ever decided to make its main focus wiping out vampires, we'd be back to &quot;why are vampires still alive.&quot;<br /> <br /> I'm assuming that because otherwise it means they can cover up military drone strikes into a European city from every agency and body that would notice or look into that so effectively that it means they basically functionally control the world, in which case again, why are vampires still alive.<br /> <br /> No, there haven't, certainly not with drone strikes.<br /> <br /> It doesn't matter where it was. Either they told people terrorists have drone strikes which has all the problems that does, or they covered up the drone strike part and thus so fully control all the organizations that would notice and have problems with drone strikes in Europe that we're back to, why are vampires still alive.<br /> <br /> These kinds of cover ups don't happen in ways that would either involve a globally destabilizing cover story, or mean that the organization doing the cover up would have to be so globally powerful that again, why are vampires alive.<br /> <br /> For it not to be a big event in the setting requires either ignoring how bad a drone strike with terrorist cover story would be, or, alternatively if the drone strike aspect itself was covered up too that the Second Inquisition so tightly controls the world that the governments, intelligence agencies, media, what have you, that would ultimately notice this thing and freakout can be prevented from doing so. In which case again, why are vampires still alive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T13:21:11-08:00","id":1467914,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467911#post1467911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think this is where our issue shines.<br /> <br /> You are acting like it was the Camarilla trying to do a cover up. It is not. It is the military, probably Austria's miitary, carrying out an operation and blaming it on Al-Qaeda. It is established that the Second Inquisition is government and military forces (+ the Vatican) versus vampires.<br /> <br /> Who are they trying to fool?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> You have mentioned that this sort of event leads to war and a change in the entirety of behavior of countries. I'm suggesting this is why it was a cover story.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> It does addres it. It says that Al Qaeda blew up the building and that is why it is a hole in the ground.<br /> <br /> If you're asking me, &quot;Does this mean that I think the Second Inquisition ordered the investigators to say it was a terrorist bombing and not a military drone strike?&quot; Then yes, I believe that is what happened and easy to happen in the World of Darkness.<br /> <br /> Because people are regularly killed, blackmailed, framed, bribed, and mind-controlled to cover up the supernatural. It is also a violent world with covert wars going on at all time.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> They would be trying to fool the media, NATO, the CIA, a variety of other national intelligence agencies, Western militaries, the governments of those nations. Alternatively, they don't need to fool them, they control all those things, and we're back to &quot;why are vampires still alive if the Second Inquisition is that powerful.&quot;<br /> <br /> Yes, and I'm suggesting that cover story is either bad and unbelievable writing for involving drone strikes, or bad and unbelievable writing for that covering up the drone strikes as well would mean the Second Inquisition controls everything I just named, in which case the problem is instead &quot;why are there any vampires left.&quot; Pick whichever one you like.<br /> <br /> You seem to be missing that my note here is that either way you want to try and handwave this, this is bad writing. Either they admitted to the drone strikes and just blamed that on terrorists, in which case, all the logical problems that ensue from that somehow just working without problems. Or, they're so powerful that they already control the various groups that would need to be fooled on the drone strikes as far as covering that up too, in which case the problem is &quot;why are vampires still alive.&quot;<br /> <br /> Each way you want to try and excuse this as not being bad writing results in major logic problems that shatter suspension of disbelief into tiny little pieces.<br /> <br /> If they said terrorists can do drone strikes, geopolitics should be destabilized. If they said &quot;terrorists blew a building up&quot; it means they control every group that could look into that or would otherwise freak out about drone strikes so hard that the idea that vampires have not yet been completely wiped out beggars belief.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Because people are regularly killed, blackmailed, framed, bribed, and mind-controlled to cover up the supernatural. It is also a violent world with covert wars going on at all time. </div> </div> </div>&quot;People&quot; are not everything from the CIA to NATO as far as what would either need to be already controlled by the SI, or be able to be fooled by the SI. You seem to feel you can ignore the difference of scale here for what th implications, and that's just not how things work.<br /> <br /> You seem to want to have it both ways, and that doesn't work out either.<br /> <br /> You want the SI to be so powerful that it already controls certainly the Western world's major governments, intelligence agencies and militaries, in which case why are vampires still alive? Because if they don't control all those things, the response to drone strikes by terrorists in Europe, and they'd certainly figure out the drone strike part, would be various flavours of freaking out.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T13:25:03-08:00","id":1467915,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467912#post1467912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think the reason you and Manfr are objecting to the interpretation is that you feel V5 gets a lot of flak on this forum and that thereby it's your job to champion it against that, if I'm going to be honest.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's really a tough job, but someone has to do it !<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467912#post1467912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If the Second Inquisition IS the government and is that internationally powerful, why are vampires still alive.</div> </div> </div> </div>This, too, is explained on Camarilla book and Corebook, the page after they speak about Wien bombings. They explain Vampires are good at subverting things, and they have limited capability in connecting dots: they thought that with Wien they blew up Vampire leadership, and also the Camarilla reacted to the debacle by better protecting itself, so after Wien and London the Inquisition has yet to strike as big. Also, the Inquisition itself is trying not to escalate the war too much, because its government wing fears crazy religious wackos will launch a Crusade and turn the world into Salem on steroids, and the religious wing fears the devilish seduction of vampires on Godless masses, thanks to the influence of Twilight and True Blood.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467912#post1467912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Those agencies, when they carry out operations, try to hide them without using cover stories that should cause global instability or otherwise try to perform them in ways that are hidden overall. Or, they're the Technocracy, in which case if the Technocracy ever decided to make its main focus wiping out vampires, we'd be back to &quot;why are vampires still alive.&quot;<br /> <br /> I'm assuming that because otherwise it means they can cover up military drone strikes into a European city from every agency and body that would notice or look into that so effectively that it means they basically functionally control the world, in which case again, why are vampires still alive.</div> </div> </div> </div>I suppose you are American, and you really believe in the Washington Post motto &quot;Democracy dies in darkness&quot;.<br /> <br /> I'm Italian, so in the history of my country we've had three terrible terrorist attacks, with hundreds of deads, and we still live in darkness about them!<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piazza_Fontana_bombing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Strage_di_piazza_Fontana.jpg/1280px-Strage_di_piazza_Fontana.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piazza_Fontana_bombing\" target=\"_blank\"> Piazza Fontana bombing - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piazza_Fontana_bombing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piazza_Fontana_bombing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bologna_massacre\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Stragedibologna-2.jpg/1280px-Stragedibologna-2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bologna_massacre\" target=\"_blank\"> Bologna massacre - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bologna_massacre\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bologna_massacre </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Itavia_Flight_870\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Aerolinee_Itavia_Flight_870.jpg/1280px-Aerolinee_Itavia_Flight_870.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Itavia_Flight_870\" target=\"_blank\"> Itavia Flight 870 - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Itavia_Flight_870\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Itavia_Flight_870 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> 60 to 40 years laters, we still don't know:<br /> <br /> -How they were carred on (in the case of Bologna, there is even people arguing the station was blew up by an accident with a smuggled missile, in Itavia case there's plenty of people convinced the US blew the plane with a missile because they were chasing after Gheddafi on another flight).<br /> <br /> -By whom, at least for sure (we have people convicted for it, but we don't know if we caught the whole conspiracy; in Ustica case, we don't have any convinctions).<br /> <br /> -Who really ordered the attacks and why (again, we have ideas, lots of ideas, tens of thousand of pages of judicial enquiries and history books, but no clear view)<br /> <br /> -How big was US and NATO involvement in supporting and then covering up the attacks (we are fairly sure they were involved in Milan, we have the doubt in Bologna and Ustica).<br /> <br /> -There was huge cover up by Italian and international secret services, and we don't know if it was something decided by deviant wings of the services, or if it was decided at the highest level. Italian secret services were decapitated for this, but we don't know if they were acting on their own, on orders by NATO, or on orders by our own government or parts of it.<br /> <br /> So, no, I'm not really bothered by the fact that the SI would have to massively corrupt, destabilize, and frame their own governments to cover up a drone attack as a terrorist attack in Wien. It has already happened thrice in my country!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12590,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","user":"Manfr","date":". 11-15-2021, 04:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T13:26:11-08:00","id":1467916,"title":"","content":"I like V5 from what I\u2019ve read and I think the SI explanation works. It\u2019s like a delicate balancing act. The SI/Coalition and their pawns on one end, the Camarilla and their pawns on the other, each side afraid of moving too fast and setting off a massive war that could devastate both sides. Also, it doesn\u2019t have to be hyper realistic. It\u2019s an RPG about vampires, after all \ud83d\ude0a.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T13:35:23-08:00","id":1467918,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467914#post1467914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> They would be trying to fool the media, NATO, the CIA, a variety of other national intelligence agencies, Western militaries, the governments of those nations. Alternatively, they don't need to fool them, they control all those things, and we're back to &quot;why are vampires still alive if the Second Inquisition is that powerful.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>No, the books are saying the operation was a joint attack by the US ARMY, supported by Vatican and Brazilian specialists, and that the SI is exactly a conspiracy of &quot;national intelligence agencies, Western militaries, the governments of those nations&quot;: if the Camarilla book says the <b>Czech Government</b> is aware of FIRSTLIGHT, why shouldn't the Austrian government know too?<br /> <br /> Also remember that FIRSTLIGHT and the Second Inquisition are projects of the NSA, and are working with ECHELON resources: it's just that they can't be overt with this. They are using black funds, and keeping it as secret as they can. Just like the majority of spycraft in the Cold War and, well ... event today ... was and is kept secret from other government officials and the mass media.<br /> <br /> Heck, NATO militaries hid from the public the existence of a network of paramilitary forces trained against Soviet invasion and disguised as civilians, some of whom were also probably involved in terrorist attacks around Europe (and, again, we don't really know): <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Gladio#First_publicly_revealed_in_Italy\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operat...ealed_in_Italy</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T14:03:58-08:00","id":1467919,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Tzimisce was big enough to devastate most of New York when he rose up in Gehenna, yet no one noticed such a manmoth slim living in the sewers. </div> </div> </div>And yet Tzimisce was big enough that it could fit into the sewers it emerged from when fleeing back into them after Cysek wounded it. Neverminding that Gehenna was a self professed series of multiple choose your own optional endings for the Vampire the Masquerade gameline, with the closest one being acknowledge as &quot;canon&quot; being Wormwood.<br /> <br /> But more importantly, before Gehenna, in Nights of Prophecy, Tzimisce was supposed to be buried so deep beneath New York that it was well beneath the sewer system itself, that you had to find tunnels carved into rock to get to it. Who would be going there to notice it? <br /> <br /> It was in New York by Night where it was decided it had recently expanded... but BJD retconned that pretty hard, with Tzimisce instead having left New York (also NYbN had most of its expansion into out of the way places, and while some of it was certainly noted as being substantial, the rest of it was noted at times as being as small as collections of fibers, puddles, and spores upon the wind. That is actually the sort of thing vampires themselves can cover up without needing to control whole international military bodies)<br /> <br /> So... whatever point you're trying to make here doesn't intersect with much.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Ebola has been widely studied and no one noticed it was an undead parasite. </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure what you think you've made as a point here. Why would they be even capable of noticing that? &quot;Ebola is a vampire&quot; is going to show up on a microscope?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Pentex released a zombie virus, and CDC knew about it because it wiped out a town. </div> </div> </div>Well again, we're back to that once upon a time, there was a globally powerful supernatural organization so potent it could cover stuff up like that no problem. It leveraged influence over pretty much everything, the CDC would be no problem for it, if it didn't already control it. It was called the Technocracy, and if that's how powerful the SI is, we're back to, why are vampires still alive again?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And no, the SI didn't tell people Al Quaeda had drones. The book isn't even clear whether most damage was covered up as counter terror operations, saying it was standard SAD modus operandi. </div> </div> </div>If the SI does not already control everything I have named, they would figure out drone strikes happened in Europe, and the results should be what they are. If the SI does control all those things, why again are vampires still alive?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The book says it was a USSOCOM operation, they are these guys<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_Special_Operations_Command\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unit...ations_Command</a><br /> <br /> I suppose they have leverage with NATO. </div> </div> </div>So why are vampires still alive again if SI control goes all the way to NATO?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As for how the attack was framed by SI, please read the books : pg. 361 V5 Corebook, pg. 78 Camarilla book.<br /> <br /> Nowhere is written they justified the attack saying Al Quaeda has military drones. </div> </div> </div>I did. They blamed it on a terrorist attack. You're trying to use the vagueness of language to insist this means the way you want to read it is the correct one.<br /> <br /> Which means two things can be the case here, and pick which one you like, and then please explain why there is definitely no writing problem with either option. Either they said terrorists took out a building in Vienna with drone strikes, and we have the problem of doing something like that making no sense for what happened next.<br /> <br /> Or! You're right, the SI controls all the governments, intelligence agencies, military, and the like it needs to as far as co opting and covering it up and making it not a big deal to these groups that drone strikes happened in a European city.<br /> <br /> In which case we have the problem of, why do vampires still exist if the SI is that powerful?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T14:26:03-08:00","id":1467921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It's really a tough job, but someone has to do it ! </div> </div> </div>Do they have to do it by saying that everyone who has a problem with V5's writing is intellectually deficient in some way compared to you?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> This, too, is explained on Camarilla book and Corebook, the page after they speak about Wien bombings. They explain Vampires are good at subverting things, and they have limited capability in connecting dots: they thought that with Wien they blew up Vampire leadership, and also the Camarilla reacted to the debacle by better protecting itself, so after Wien and London the Inquisition has yet to strike as big. Also, the Inquisition itself is trying not to escalate the war too much, because its government wing fears crazy religious wackos will launch a Crusade and turn the world into Salem on steroids, and the religious wing fears the devilish seduction of vampires on Godless masses, thanks to the influence of Twilight and True Blood. </div> </div> </div>If the SI is so powerful that they don't need to cover up drone strikes in Europe from every military and intelligence agency in the Western World (and frankly several beyond it) and their governments otherwise, because they already control them, this explanation is even worse writing. If the SI is already that powerful, it shouldn't be a problem to kill out vampires. If the SI has that much global reach and coordination, then the idea that vampires can otherwise successfully hide from them doesn't logically process. Especially when things like the Camarilla are badly damaged as far as global response. If the SI is as powerful and influential as you would need it to be for the things you are saying to make sense as far as drone strikes, then the SI is capable of coordinating global responses to things in a way that straight up has not existed in the world to this point. The idea that vampires can survive that by &quot;better protecting themselves&quot; is deeply thin. The idea that the SI would fear the things you are talking about when they have that much control, when they control the narrative so tightly, makes no sense.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I suppose you are American, and you really believe in the Washington Post motto &quot;Democracy dies in darkness&quot;. </div> </div> </div>I'm Canadian and I'd again like to ask if you find it possible to dial back your personal, condescending contempt for the idea that I don't find some of V5's writing well put together, this is some impressively directly insulting stuff. You're at the point of trying to both guess my nationality (incorrectly) and then belittle me for it. Do you think this makes the things you say come off well? Your argument is currently straight up &quot;well Americans are dumb and don't understand how the world really works anyway.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> So, no, I'm not really bothered by the fact that the SI would have to massively corrupt, destabilize, and frame their own governments to cover up a drone attack as a terrorist attack in Wien. It has already happened thrice in my country! </div> </div> </div>Nothing you are talking about is comparable to the idea of drone strikes in a European city being covered up by blaming Islamic terrorists. This happened in 2008, when, to put it mildly, the western world was primed to receive being told something like that, in a particular way. Your response to that not being a problem now veers wildly between comparing it to situations that occurred within completely different contexts, and ignoring that to prevent that reaction, you instead advance the idea that the governments of the western world, their intelligence agencies, NATO, the media, what have you, are so fully under the SI's thumb that they can make it not be a problem, then ignore that this instead gives a new problem of &quot;why are there still vampires?&quot; You attempt to address that question by using explanations that would make no sense as obstacles for something that powerful and widespread.<br /> <br /> Drone strike capacity is a huge deal. It is supposed to be a thing only advanced nations can do. If stateless terrorist groups develop that capacity, even forgetting people on the street for a moment, militaries, intelligence agencies, governments, and the like across the globe would veer sharply into having to reassess their entire security and strategic paradigm, or, put more simply, they would freak out. Especially when everything they have in place to try and advance warn against that kind of thing apparently just completely failed. It would reflect an unheard of advancement in the capacity for warfare by stateless actors. There would be massive investigations into attempting to figure out what happened by these bodies.<br /> <br /> Your attempt to say that's not a problem is to say &quot;well the SI already controls them, so they're in on what happened, and they all just told the public it was a normal bombing.&quot; In that case the SI is pretty close to controlling straight up the world. In which case vampires should be dead, hiding from the SI should be near impossible, and the book attempting to excuse otherwise comes off as if realizing the mistakes of their writing, and papering them over in a way that exacerbates the problem.<br /> <br /> So again, I'm definitely curious if the SI book is going to address &quot;drone striked Vienna&quot;, because it is a piece of bad writing that makes big ol chunks of the SI come off as not making sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","user":"MarkK","date":". 11-15-2021, 05:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T14:41:27-08:00","id":1467923,"title":"","content":"Oh, we are at it again: I disagree with your circular logic, so you try to manipulate my words in order to show I'm insulting you. It's a boring technique to use, it kills discussion. But no problem, I will quit this thread too. You're right, bad writing and no possible explanation whatsoever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T14:44:08-08:00","id":1467924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467923#post1467923\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, we are at it again: I disagree with your circular logic, so you try to manipulate my words in order to show I'm insulting you. It's a boring technique to use, it kills discussion. But no problem, I will quit this thread too. You're right, bad writing and no possible explanation whatsoever.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If you feel that calling out an entire nationality and accusing them of not being capable of understanding the world is not insulting that nationality, I really have no idea what to tell you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T14:51:01-08:00","id":1467925,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467919#post1467919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And yet Tzimisce was big enough that it could fit into the sewers it emerged from when fleeing back into them after Cysek wounded it. Neverminding that Gehenna was a self professed series of multiple choose your own optional endings for the Vampire the Masquerade gameline, with the closest one being acknowledge as &quot;canon&quot; being Wormwood.<br /> <br /> But more importantly, before Gehenna, in Nights of Prophecy, Tzimisce was supposed to be buried so deep beneath New York that it was well beneath the sewer system itself, that you had to find tunnels carved into rock to get to it. Who would be going there to notice it?<br /> <br /> It was in New York by Night where it was decided it had recently expanded... but BJD retconned that pretty hard, with Tzimisce instead having left New York (also NYbN had most of its expansion into out of the way places, and while some of it was certainly noted as being substantial, the rest of it was noted at times as being as small as collections of fibers, puddles, and spores upon the wind. That is actually the sort of thing vampires themselves can cover up without needing to control whole international military bodies)<br /> <br /> So... whatever point you're trying to make here doesn't intersect with much.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, so there was just a little bit of Tzimisce here and there. The part where he goes Godzilla must have been overstated.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467919#post1467919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure what you think you've made as a point here. Why would they be even capable of noticing that? &quot;Ebola is a vampire&quot; is going to show up on a microscope?</div> </div> </div> </div>Perhaps. Is it established in canon that Tzimisce methuselahs show as virus tissue on microscopes?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467919#post1467919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well again, we're back to that once upon a time, there was a globally powerful supernatural organization so potent it could cover stuff up like that no problem. It leveraged influence over pretty much everything, the CDC would be no problem for it, if it didn't already control it. It was called the Technocracy, and if that's how powerful the SI is, we're back to, why are vampires still alive again?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know, ask the writers of Project Twilight in 199something.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467919#post1467919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So why are vampires still alive again if SI control goes all the way to NATO?</div> </div> </div> </div>Taliban have been bombed by NATO for the best part of the last 20 years, and they have just conquered Afghanistan.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467919#post1467919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I did. They blamed it on a terrorist attack. You're trying to use the vagueness of language to insist this means the way you want to read it is the correct one.<br /> <br /> Which means two things can be the case here, and pick which one you like, and then please explain why there is definitely no writing problem with either option. Either they said terrorists took out a building in Vienna with drone strikes, and we have the problem of doing something like that making no sense for what happened next.<br /> <br /> Or! You're right, the SI controls all the governments, intelligence agencies, military, and the like it needs to as far as co opting and covering it up and making it not a big deal to these groups that drone strikes happened in a European city.<br /> <br /> In which case we have the problem of, why do vampires still exist if the SI is that powerful?</div> </div> </div> </div>I've already explained to you my interpretation: they used a bunker buster, probably to crush the magical defences of the chantry, they went in with special forces, and then they said &quot;terrorists blew up a building&quot;. End. They don't need to to say that &quot;terrorists took out a building in Vienna with drone strikes&quot;, they just need to say that terrorists took out a building, and no one will be able to tell the difference.<br /> <br /> I know that you just said that they do not apply, but please notice that we still don't know what exactly has destroyed nor Itavia 870 nor the Bologna train station? Were they missiles? Were they explosives? Were they civilian explosives? Were they military.grade explosives? We don't know, and italian and international secret services have been openly acknowledge to try to frame false explanations about this.<br /> <br /> And yet, the NSA cannot cover up the explosion of a single building in Wien.<br /> <br /> I suppose that we should just agree to disagree permantently, IDK, it seems we just cannot have a constructive discussion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12590,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","user":"Manfr","date":". 11-15-2021, 06:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T15:04:28-08:00","id":1467927,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarkK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467924#post1467924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> If you feel that calling out an entire nationality and accusing them of not being capable of understanding the world is not insulting that nationality, I really have no idea what to tell you.</div> </div> </div> </div>IDK where you yread that I called Americans deficient, I just meant that there is a consistent narrative, in American and American-influenced media, that somehows plots will be discovered by loyal agents of the State or by enterprising journalists. That was what you implied by repeating, multiple times in a single post, multiple posts in the discussion, that there was absolutely no way the Inquisition could frame a terrorist attack in a major European city.<br /> Then I pointed you at three terrorist attacks, with very heavy casualties, in which government agents and international secret services were actively involved in denying the truth. <br /> <br /> End, no insults meant and my excuses if you felt insulted. Surely I don't what to get another warning for something I definitely didn't mean to do. And with this last clarification, I leave, I feel we have already discussed in depth our respective positions and disagreements.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T15:09:22-08:00","id":1467930,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Taliban have been bombed by NATO for the best part of the last 20 years, and they have just conquered Afghanistan. </div> </div> </div>The Taliban had the more or less support of Pakistan, the benefit of the war effort against it from near the jump being largely spearheaded and staffed in the majority by an American government that decided to invade and occupy two countries at once for various baffling reasons (with most of the other countries opting out as time went by), and being able to flee into rough undeveloped countryside where considerable portions of the population wanted to shelter them, especially as the corruption of the new government and affiliated warlords became more pronounced. At that, most militaries and governments outside of America after an initial rush of enthusiasm ultimately could at best be described as wavering on how hard or how much they wanted to try at this particular thing. They further benefitted from it being a public war that as it dragged on for years, significantly lost public support and enthusiasm. They had sufficient equipment, support and funding to be able to even while having war waged on them. They had a replaceable leadership.<br /> <br /> The Taliban did not suffer from being magical blood drinking vampires who can only be active for basically half the day, the vast majority of whom need to stay in cities where their food is, nor from facing a global body that, to be consistent with your logic, would be so coordinated and unified as to not have to deal with any of the issues the United States did when fighting the Taliban. <br /> <br /> These are non analogous situations.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I've already explained to you, but you are adamant in your circular logic: they used a bunker buster, probably to crush the magical defences of the chantry, they went in with special forces, and then they said &quot;terrorists blew up a building&quot;. End. They don't need to to say that &quot;terrorists took out a building in Vienna with drone strikes&quot;, they just need to say that terrorists took out a building, and no one will be able to tell the difference. </div> </div> </div>If they don't control the governments, militaries, intelligence agencies and the like of the Western World, they definitely would have needed to say something better than &quot;terrorists blew up a building.&quot; as far as staving off the results of that attack being looked into. If they do control all those things and thus they're all in on it, they nearly control the world, and attempting to say why vampires are then not dead has so far boiled down to bringing up non comparable situation, and writing that fails to tackle the ramifications of a group that would be that powerful and influential.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I know that you just said that they do not apply, but please notice that we still don't know what exactly has destroyed nor Itavia 870 nor the Bologna train station? Were they missiles? Were they explosives? Were they civilian explosives? Were they military.grade explosives? We don't know, and italian and international secret services have been openly acknowledge to try to frame false explanations about this. </div> </div> </div>You are definitely intent on trying to compare situations not involving drone strikes to ones involving drone strikes. You can keep trying to, but it will keep having that problem.<br /> <br /> You are comparing things that would not change the military paradigm of the Western world to something that would. It thereby falls flat.<br /> <br /> Either the SI controls the world so hard it can prevent that, in which case why are vampires, or it doesn't and all the other problems I mentioned come back. Which do you prefer?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And yet, the NSA cannot cover up the explosion of a single building in Wien. </div> </div> </div>With drone strikes? From everything in place to give advance warning of that kind of thing? From a world whose security paradigm has been completely reoriented in a post 9/11 world in very particular ways? Not unless they control allll the things you're saying they already do anyway. In which case, if they do, once again, why are vampires?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I suppose that we should just agree to disagree permantently, IDK, it seems we just cannot have a constructive discussion. </div> </div> </div>Sure does seem that way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T15:42:17-08:00","id":1467931,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467927#post1467927\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> IDK where you yread that I called Americans deficient, I just meant that there is a consistent narrative, in American and American-influenced media, that somehows plots will be discovered by loyal agents of the State or by enterprising journalists. That was what you implied by repeating, multiple times in a single post, multiple posts in the discussion, that there was absolutely no way the Inquisition could frame a terrorist attack in a major European city.<br /> Then I pointed you at three terrorist attacks, with very heavy casualties, in which government agents and international secret services were actively involved in denying the truth.<br /> <br /> End, no insults meant and my excuses if you felt insulted. Surely I don't what to get another warning for something I definitely didn't mean to do. And with this last clarification, I leave, I feel we have already discussed in depth our respective positions and disagreements.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You are attempting to further state that Americans are basically deluded en masse by their media to believe the world works in a way it does not, compared to you, who knows the truth. That you feel this is not insultingly condescending to them is kind of your own issue.<br /> <br /> That you are attempting to compare attacks not involving major military tech on the scale being otherwise discussed (you're at the point of seriously talking about bunker buster bombs) with one that did, on the ground of a major European city, is similarly, your own issue.<br /> <br /> That you are ignoring the sheer depth government agents and international secret services would have to be integrated and coopted thereby to both permit an attack like this and make sure certainly Western agencies and bodies do not instead flip out about it, as far as what that would mean for how powerful the SI would have to be, again, your own issue.<br /> <br /> I'll try and say this more directly since you keep applying really reductionist arguments to dismissing it. We live in a modern world full of technology that has gone well beyond the times you are talking about, where countries and agencies and what all thing are super nervous about trying to track stuff like building obliterating explosions that resemble coming from drone strikes (or bunker buster bombs of all things), as closely as possible. Satellites are even purposed to that kind of thing. The idea of non stateless actors acquiring drone strike technology on par with that of developed nations (which is what you would have if they had the technology to straight up end a building in the middle of Europe with one) probably keeps these groupings up at night with dread. This isn't some thing in some airspace somewhere. It's an attack, right on the ground, of a major European city, using major military technology. <br /> <br /> If these things are not thus in on said plot, that crap will be noticed, and then they'll freak. And if these things are instead in on said plot? Well hey, we're right back at &quot;why are vampires still alive if the SI controls that much of the socipolitical organization of the world.&quot;<br /> <br /> Edit: It's also kind of a thing to go &quot;here's why you are in fact completely wrong and why Americans are fools who believe nonsense, but now I will leave the discussion.&quot; Trying to take parting shots at people while you go, it's not great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","user":"MarkK","date":". 11-15-2021, 07:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T16:24:47-08:00","id":1467935,"title":"","content":"I for one always got the impression that the attack in Vienna was conducted via a drone, there was an explosion that destroyed the chantry. Shortly afterwards Special Forces swarmed the area eliminated the remaining vampires and locked the place down.<br /> <br /> So the question then becomes what do they need asset-wise to do that?<br /> 1 Drone<br /> 1 Missile<br /> 30-60 Soldiers<br /> Permission to operate in a NATO country<br /> A cover story that will hold up to public scrutiny.<br /> A cover story that will hold up to governmental scrutiny.<br /> <br /> <b>Military Resources</b><br /> Those first four things can easily be sorted out by a high ranking enough military commander, especially if part of an international alliance of several of them, with intelligence-sharing arrangements. (We can assume that the SOCCOM drone strike was authorised after US intelligence shared information with Austria about the target. The forces were likely Austrian ones associated with Austria's special forces and intelligence services.)<br /> <br /> In the world of darkness especially where shadowy conspiracies gain access to this sort of tech all the time, I don't think it's beyond the pale.<br /> <br /> <b>Civilian Cover-Story</b><br /> Now the civilian cover story can be as simple as they stated it. There was a terrorist attack with a very large explosive device, there is nothing in the text stating they claim it was an Islamist drone strike, nothing saying the public are aware a drone strike was involved. As far as Joe-public is concerned, one moment there was a building in Vienna, the next a crater swarming with special forces and emergency responders.<br /> <br /> How are any of them going to be able to tell a conventional bombing from a drone strike with the information they'll have access to? Journalists won't have been able to get anywhere near the site before the SI can secure it. Any emergency worker involved will likely have had to sign the official secrets act, and the majority won't be able to differentiate a drone strike from a conventional bombing either. (Nor would they care to, they'd have more pressing concerns.)<br /> <br /> Anyone who tried to provide a counter-narrative would just be tarred as a conspiracy theorist. Psy-Ops 101, the SI is more than capable of such basic misinformation.<br /> <br /> <b>Governmental Cover-Story</b><br /> Okay so this now needs to deal with several different types of government agencies:<br /> <br /> <b>1) The Military/Intelligence Apparatus:</b> We know the SI doesn't integrate entire agencies, armies, or even units. It's a shadowy conspiracy, a few commanders or spies here, a spec-ops team there. The majority of people in the military/intelligence community have no idea 'blank-bodies' are a threat or that there is an international coalition to deal with them.<br /> <br /> Will some people be suspicious in those groups? Sure and those suspicious people will be dealt with by the conspiracy. (Recruited, re-posted, discredited, killed, etc.)<br /> <br /> The vast majority though, won't know an operation has even happened. The information would be kept on a strictly need to know basis. At the end of the day Sgt Smith's superior officer might've been directly involved in Vienna, that doesn't mean that Sgt Smith knows anything.<br /> <br /> <b>2) The Native Civilian Government: </b>Who are the government going to ask about a terror attack? The military and intelligence agencies, who will have been the ones to position themselves to answer these questions? The members of those institutions who're in the SI, who'll use every trick in the book: off the record disclosures, black-ops, the official secrets act, keeping information secret for 'national security, etc.<br /> <br /> The civilian government will be fed just enough information to make sure they come to the conclusions that the SI want them to. What sort of resources would that take? Control over which EOD techs examine the site, which crime-scene investigators are involved, and then which agents write the reports for committees and ministers. That's not a lot of people in the grand scheme of things.<br /> <br /> <b>3) Foreign Governments: </b>Now foreign governments are going to be interested. But you can be sure that anything a domestic government doesn't have a full picture on, a foreign government will have even less of a picture on. A domestic government is going to keep the details under control, if only so they can dictate the narrative.<br /> <br /> <b>Notes - The above still doesn't address:</b><br /> 1) Secrecy amongst SI assets, within their own organisations.<br /> 2) The likely contribution of Camarilla assets in covering things up for their own good. (Last thing they want is mass public interest in a former vampire hotspot.)<br /> 3) This doesn't address that we're not given the full story. We're not given an exacting account of what the cover-up looked like, we don't know exactly what the public was told, how the investigation was handled, etc. Primarily because that's not the important part of the story, the important part for playing the game about mythical vampires is the 'government' blew up Tremere-central and the damage that's been done to the clan. Partly to change the status-quo of the Tremere, partly to show how dangerous the SI is.<br /> 4) This event happened once, this was the SI throwing all their: influence, assets, control, and power. It's not like this is a common-occurrence happening left right and centre, there is no indication that the SI can do this casually. (On the contrary, other depictions of the SI would seem to show the exact opposite.)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STV Author - <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/374164/Guide-to-the-Sabbat?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=0_0_45624_0_0_0_0\" target=\"_blank\">Guide to the Sabbat</a> <br /> Current Project(s): Tales from the Fronts - A Guide to the Gehenna War","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25061-karos","name":"Karos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25061_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T16:37:05-08:00","id":1467939,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467915#post1467915\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's really a tough job, but someone has to do it !</div> </div> </div> </div>Ahn... no. No one has to do it. Certainly can, but do not have to.<br /> <br /> On my part, you did achieve something, though. You achieved to convince me that the SI is so more powerful and well informed than the Technocracy ever was that they pretty much are unstoppable in every sense of the word and the setting makes no sense as anything but survival horror for vampires.<br /> <br /> I agree that vampires would still exist. They just don't have any leverage over institutions anymore and are scattered in hide-holes across the world. Not my cup of tea, but may be fun to play sometimes.<br /> <br /> What doesn't make a lot of sense now is the Sabbat and Anarchs not being completely wiped-out by now since they obviously don't stand a chance without the Camarilla's expertise in laying down below radar.<br /> <br /> There's a setting called Chronicles of Darkness where humanity is under the gripe of some weird spiritual disease that effectively induces complacency, and several high profile supernatural actors stand as suspects for causing this strange malady.<br /> <br /> But as far as I knew, this is the World of Darkness, where super conspiracies effectively fight for the control of the media and attention of the masses in a bid to shape reality, and not just in Mage where this is literally the case, and the Law of Secrecy is strictly maintained because one of the horrors is the very fact that humanity <b>will </b>strike back if they found out. <b>And the Second Inquisition isn't one of those conspiracies, but the living proof that this fear has merit.</b><br /> <br /> On Real Life, terrorist attacks with a similar scale pretty much <b>did</b> changed the <i>status quo</i> every time. Victimized countries enter in political upheaval. A thorough investigation is conducted to find liable parties. Reforms, changes of policies, public debate sometimes leading to violence. Yes, such attacks happen, but they pretty much shake up things royally.<br /> <br /> You even demonstrate it yourself. The three attacks in Italy you mentioned are all targets of major cover-ups. Sure. <b>Still you're proof that the cover-up failed</b>. The causes aren't known, but the matter itself isn't settled and the case is reopened time and again. People got arrested, fingers were pointed. The attacks had further consequences regardless of the cover-up.<br /> <br /> My greatest problem is the inconsistency of V5 that don't commit to anything it proposes to do. You say now that the SI is colluded with every nation and institution involved, and the book does seem to support this sometimes. But at others it states directly that SI agents act in secret, without support from their superiors in their respective institutions. Those can't be simultaneously true, either they're in control or they're not. Whatever it is, the game should then follow with the appropriate conclusions instead of back-pedaling all the time to preserve <i>status quo</i>.<br /> <br /> For everyone's information, an attack of the scope of the destruction of the Vienna Chantry is likely to attract a lot of attention even if just on a random spot on the woods (which wasn't exactly the case). It isn't just military and government institutions that must be silenced, but also journalists, the social media and public investigations.<br /> <br /> Controlling the leakage of information is also very different from sustaining legal deniability or control over official narrative. An SI that can avoid legal repercussion for themselves is a very different beast from an SI that can pressure officials into releasing any cover-up they want, and both are again very different from an SI that can actually make almost everyone believe it.<br /> <br /> Personally, I want the SI book to address those things, although I don't have high expectations. What's the price they paid for the strike? How they keep their more bold moves from being discovered? After all, do they have higher-ups under their sway or are they just a ragtag cooperation of rogue agents? How do they deal with <b>important </b>people finding evidence against them? Do they have effective governmental cover-up, or do they have to cover-up <i>from</i> their governments? How are they stopping the Masquerade break when they are the weak point of the Masquerade themselves?<br /> <br /> Sorry, but I want actual answers from the books instead of assumptions from fans that change with the discussion because the few excerpts available are actually painting an inconsistent picture of the organization.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467900#post1467900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">IDK, everyone seemed to get along just fine with the fact that nobody noticed Pentex had gone Raccoon City with a small town, the sewers of New York hosted the Tzimisce Antediluvian, or that Ebola was a Tzimisce Methuselah, yet now we are shocked by the Second Inquisition telling everyone &quot;Yes, Al Quaeda used a drone to blow up a building&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>What is your point with that? We can't complain of a plot hole? Why? What's the problem with pointing out inconsistency in the writing? Just because <b>you</b> think I go along with the examples presented?<br /> <br /> This was just dismissive with people that disagree instead of adding anything to any side of the conversation.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467906#post1467906\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ebola has been widely studied and no one noticed it was an undead parasite.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a virus. <b>It is an undead parasite by definition</b>. That's a part of the joke.<br /> <br /> Seriously, there's no way to define what would be the telltale of a vampire virus.<br /> <br /> Also, upon a terrorist attack a huge amount of people try to understand the fine details of what happened, not just virologists.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465534-preview-of-the-si-book?p=1467911#post1467911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It is the military, probably Austria's miitary, carrying out an operation and blaming it on Al-Qaeda.</div> </div> </div> </div>It wasn't Austria's own military or NATO. The specific force in the Vienna Incident was composed by US, Brazil and Vatican.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T16:46:57-08:00","id":1467941,"title":"","content":"I'm gonna bold this one.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Permission to operate in a NATO country</b><br /> A cover story that will hold up to public scrutiny.<br /> A cover story that will hold up to governmental scrutiny. </div> </div> </div>If they have that for the military operation they did, we're right back into how are vampires.<br /> <br /> This is a huge thing to just jump off from and not ponder the sheer implications.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Military Resources</b><br /> Those first four things can easily be sorted out by a high ranking enough military commander, especially if part of an international alliance of several of them, with intelligence-sharing arrangements. (We can assume that the SOCCOM drone strike was authorised after US intelligence shared information with Austria about the target. The forces were likely Austrian ones associated with Austria's special forces and intelligence services.)<br /> <br /> In the world of darkness especially where shadowy conspiracies gain access to this sort of tech all the time, I don't think it's beyond the pale. </div> </div> </div>It's not beyond the pale... for the Technocracy. And we're right back again to how are vampires.<br /> <br /> Again, these arguments seem to involve having to just blithely hurry past as fast as possible statements that would have to have major structural implications. If there is an international alliance involving high enough ranking military commanders that can get permission to operate in NATO countries to make drone strikes, that is a level of institutional power and organization that.. once more, see above.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Civilian Cover-Story</b><br /> Now the civilian cover story can be as simple as they stated it. There was a terrorist attack with a very large explosive device, there is nothing in the text stating they claim it was an Islamist drone strike, nothing saying the public are aware a drone strike was involved. As far as Joe-public is concerned, one moment there was a building in Vienna, the next a crater swarming with special forces and emergency responders.<br /> <br /> How are any of them going to be able to tell a conventional bombing from a drone strike with the information they'll have access to? Journalists won't have been able to get anywhere near the site before the SI can secure it. Any emergency worker involved will likely have had to sign the official secrets act, and the majority won't be able to differentiate a drone strike from a conventional bombing either. (Nor would they care to, they'd have more pressing concerns.)<br /> <br /> Anyone who tried to provide a counter-narrative would just be tarred as a conspiracy theorist. Psy-Ops 101, the SI is more than capable of such basic misinformation. </div> </div> </div>This again glosses over that to conceal these things in this way means the various government and military forces were in on this effort to the degree that again, see above.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>1) The Military/Intelligence Apparatus:</b> We know the SI doesn't integrate entire agencies, armies, or even units. </div> </div> </div>Yes, that's part of why this, no matter how you want to try to excuse it, doesn't work as far as dodging &quot;why do vampires still exist if the SI is this powerful&quot;. You yourself are already talking about permission to operate in a NATO country, international alliance, high enough ranking military commanders, US intelligence..<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The majority of people in the military/intelligence community have no idea 'blank-bodies' are a threat or that there is an international coalition to deal with them. </div> </div> </div>And yet the SI for this constructed reasoning is still powerful enough to set up drone strikes in NATO countries with permission for their operations.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>2) The Native Civilian Government: </b>Who are the government going to ask about a terror attack? The military and intelligence agencies, who will have been the ones to position themselves to answer these questions? </div> </div> </div>Saying this, contradicts this:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> We know the SI doesn't integrate entire agencies, armies, or even units. </div> </div> </div>It is again, really okay to acknowledge something is just not well written instead of having to get into torturous and contradictory logic to claim otherwise.<br /> <br /> Either the SI integrates agencies and armies, or it doesn't. This argument seems to truck in a rationale where the SI's power changes from moment to moment to justify the claim that needs to be made at the time.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The members of those institutions who're in the SI, who'll use every trick in the book: off the record disclosures, black-ops, the official secrets act, keeping information secret for 'national security, etc. </div> </div> </div>Unless they are in positions of such considerable influence in their institutions as to be able to hoodwink and manipulate them, this is a massive handwave. And if they are, they basically control them anyway, in which case we're right back to the how are vampires thing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Sure and those suspicious people will be dealt with by the conspiracy. (Recruited, re-posted, discredited, killed, etc.) </div> </div> </div>If the conspiracy is this powerful, why are there still vampires.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>3) Foreign Governments: </b>Now foreign governments are going to be interested. But you can be sure that anything a domestic government doesn't have a full picture on, a foreign government will have even less of a picture on. A domestic government is going to keep the details under control, if only so they can dictate the narrative. </div> </div> </div>&quot;Well that explosion didn't look like anything they're claiming, and probably satellites and radar have been messed with, but we're not going to look at that too hard, because reasons.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> A domestic government is going to keep the details under control, if only so they can dictate the narrative. </div> </div> </div>That's definitely one take on a building being wiped out in the middle of a European city that then gets blamed on terrorists in 2008.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 2) The likely contribution of Camarilla assets in covering things up for their own good. (Last thing they want is mass public interest in a former vampire hotspot.) </div> </div> </div>The Camarilla was at this point being rocked so hard entire cities were being depopulated of vampires.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 3) This doesn't address that we're not given the full story. We're not given an exacting account of what the cover-up looked like, we don't know exactly what the public was told, how the investigation was handled, etc. Primarily because that's not the important part of the story, the important part for playing the game about mythical vampires is the 'government' blew up Tremere-central and the damage that's been done to the clan. Partly to change the status-quo of the Tremere, partly to show how dangerous the SI is. </div> </div> </div>If something doesn't make sense, opting to &quot;it makes sense if you consider offscreen details you have to make up for yourself, because actually you don't have the full story&quot; doesn't come off as good writing, it comes off as narrative laziness.<br /> <br /> It doesn't feel like it's a lot for some reason to expect a book to deal with the ramifications of its own plot stuff. If it doesn't, barring telepathy into the minds of the writers, it mostly just comes off as not having wanted to think out the implications of the writing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 4) This event happened once, this was the SI throwing all their: influence, assets, control, and power. It's not like this is a common-occurrence happening left right and centre, there is no indication that the SI can do this casually. (On the contrary, other depictions of the SI would seem to show the exact opposite.) </div> </div> </div>Then you are contradicting all that stuff you said before about instead how easily plausible it is.<br /> <br /> Which still doesn't deal with the problem that even if this was the biggest thing the SI ever did, it still requires a sheer level of institutional control, access and influence on an international scale that we're back into the &quot;why are vampires still alive&quot; box.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","user":"MarkK","date":". 11-15-2021, 08:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T17:47:37-08:00","id":1467950,"title":"","content":"I think the SI is going to be portrayed a number of ways, not the least being that they are going to be every bit as corrupt, cruel, inefficient, and alternatively genius versus incompetent. For example, I have no difficulty believing the Second Inquisition can and will conduct all manner of anti-terrorist operations throughout the world as well as military activities that should blow the Masquerade wide open.<br /> <br /> We've seen Operation: Antigen in London, the massive &quot;gang war&quot; that happened in LA by Night, the military operations that attacked the largest building in Vienna (in the Mausoleum), and undoubtedly many other acts of kidnapping, torture, and mass murder.<br /> <br /> I also believe the Second Inquisition will get away with these with almost no oversight because the World of Darkness is full of corrupt, lazy, ignorant, and uniformed masses who are utterly uninterested in the truth. That is the basis of the game that the supernatural is real and no one believes in it because they prefer to wallow in their own ignorance. It is not the REAL world and the fact people expect it to be is something I feel that's a mistake.<br /> <br /> I also fully expect that the Second Inquisition will have members who want to commit genocide, members who don't want to commit the necessary resources to destroy all vampires, members who just want to monitor the situation, members who want to use the Kindred, and those who would LOVE to commit genocide but are of the mind that it would be too expensive/require too many resources.<br /> <br /> I expect them to be ignorant Right Wing paranoics who are convinced of their own righteousness but vicious as well as incompetant in other ways. I expect large amounts of casualties and people attacking vampires at night along with perfectly planned operations in equal measure. The Second Inquisition should be like the War on Drugs and War on Terror.<br /> <br /> Tens of thousands of casualties but the vampires never go extinct and even thrive eventually.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T17:59:02-08:00","id":1467952,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <str